💡 **SUGGESTION: `spec.extra` is dead — no caller ever passes it**

`triggerConfiguredAutoStartWorkflow(autoStart, ticketKey, customParams, config, spec)` supports `spec.extra` merged into the trigger options bag:

```javascript
if (spec.extra) {
    Object.assign(triggerOptions, spec.extra);
}
```

But the only two callers — `triggerAutoStartReviewWorkflow` and `triggerAutoStartReworkWorkflow` — build `spec` as literal `{ flag, label }` objects and never set `extra`. The branch suggests an extension point nobody uses, and it survives purely to keep the trigger "generic". Consider dropping the `extra` handling (two lines) until a caller actually needs it — the function stays the single canonical trigger either way.
